WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Not everyone will have a radio.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.700
Narrator: Majed doesn't have one today.

3
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:10.600
Narrator: He stays with the fan, and signals the nearest colleague: palm opening and closing - need supervisor.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.800
Narrator: Noura answers with the same signal - copy - and passes it on to her supervisor.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.300
Narrator: The message is now in the chain.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Narrator: And Majed never leaves the fan.

